  "body": "A rare combination of timeless character, modern comfort and spectacular coastal views, this remarkable home occupies an exceptional 1,047sqm freehold site in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal enclaves.\r\n\r\nFrom almost every room, wide windows and doors frame uninterrupted views across the sparkling coastline to Rangitoto Island. Inside, stained-glass windows, decorative mouldings and polished timber floors blend beautifully with considered contemporary updates, creating interiors filled with warmth, character and presence.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen is a natural gathering point, where a sweeping northeast-facing outlook provides a stunning backdrop from morning coffee through to evening drinks. The adjoining living room is equally inviting, with a statement fireplace, bay window and generous proportions providing an elegant space to relax or entertain.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the views are even more impressive, with peaceful bedrooms offering calm retreats. Two bathrooms on this level, plus a further bathroom downstairs, provide excellent family convenience. Outside, an expansive deck captures the coastal setting, perfect for long lunches beneath the Pohutukawa or relaxed evenings overlooking the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nAdding flexibility, the self-contained minor dwelling above the double garage is ideal for extended family, guests or additional income. A sweeping driveway and generous off-street parking complete the picture.\r\n\r\nPositioned between Hauraki and Belmont, the location combines coastal living with everyday convenience. Shops, cafes and eateries are nearby, while Takapuna and Devonport are easily accessible, alongside beautiful beaches, sought-after schools and motorway connections.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of character, scale, flexibility and views are rarely available. This is an exceptional opportunity to secure a truly special coastal residence.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n* 1,047sqm freehold site\r\n* Spectacular Rangitoto and coastal views\r\n* Timeless character with modern enhancements\r\n* Sun-drenched northeast-facing kitchen\r\n* Expansive deck for entertaining\r\n* Three bathrooms across the main home\r\n* Self-contained minor dwelling above double garage\r\n* Prime position between Hauraki and Belmont",
